(6757676, 1013126, 142766, '<td valign="top">I voted 6 because the photo is technically correct, but it could be more interesting to look at : maybe at night, or using another point of view (from inside the pyramid, or closer to the pyramid). You also could have played with the sun reflections, or waited for another type of clouds (although they should not appear in a "straight" theme). Well done, but will be better next time : good luck !</td>', 'I voted 6 because the photo is technically correct, but it could be more interesting to look at : maybe at night, or using another point of view (from inside the pyramid, or closer to the pyramid). You also could have played with the sun reflections, or waited for another type of clouds (although they should not appear in a "straight" theme). Well done, but will be better next time : good luck !', '2012-05-02 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6757723, 1012394, 138253, '<td valign="top">I had a lot of fun tripping out coworkers with this image. by keeping a little bit of it off-screen and using the mouse wheel to move the image i gave them all a good feeling of vertigo. 8/10 for the image, +2 for letting me make some people nauseous. :)<br/>Thanks for the fun :)</td>', 'I had a lot of fun tripping out coworkers with this image. by keeping a little bit of it off-screen and using the mouse wheel to move the image i gave them all a good feeling of vertigo. 8/10 for the image, +2 for letting me make some people nauseous. :)Thanks for the fun :)', '2012-05-02 12:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
