(6757801, 1012161, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark and could have been somewhat brighter. It looks underexposed. I think the horizon is rotated just fine, in case you are getting comments that say otherwise.</td>', 'This is a little dark and could have been somewhat brighter. It looks underexposed. I think the horizon is rotated just fine, in case you are getting comments that say otherwise.', '2012-05-02 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
