(6758466, 1013126, 142570, '<td valign="top">Hi Chuck, this is a good idea; obviously you chose the minimalism and the communication between simple materials: glass, iron, air, water(clouds). That was a excellent option. I do have 2 remarks that could advantageously impact the reading of your picture: 1) Transparency could have been better exploited, perhaps with a more populated sky (but you are not God, you are just Chuck) 2) The structure of the pyramid is a bit confusing (too many lines in too many directions), perhaps it could have been simplified by changing the point of view (?). However this is a good picture. Congrats :-))</td>', 'Hi Chuck, this is a good idea; obviously you chose the minimalism and the communication between simple materials: glass, iron, air, water(clouds). That was a excellent option. I do have 2 remarks that could advantageously impact the reading of your picture: 1) Transparency could have been better exploited, perhaps with a more populated sky (but you are not God, you are just Chuck) 2) The structure of the pyramid is a bit confusing (too many lines in too many directions), perhaps it could have been simplified by changing the point of view (?). However this is a good picture. Congrats :-))', '2012-05-03 06:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
